  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 513.23 Hearse Plate",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 513.23 Hearse Plate.\n\n(a) Hearse plates shall be issued to vehicles designed and employed as hearses, and owned and operated by a person licensed and registered pursuant to RSA 325:20.\n\n(b) Hearse plates shall have 3 to 5 characters, the first and last of which shall be plus signs, and the remainder of which shall be numerals from one to 999.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12 (from Saf-C 514.21); renumbered by #12914 (formerly Saf-C 514.22); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 514.23)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
